WEBVTT

01:41.320 --> 01:45.990
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.680 --> 01:48.910
[Episode 23]

01:54.039 --> 01:54.509
Oh no.

01:55.400 --> 01:56.640
It's worse than I imagined.

01:57.590 --> 01:58.320
The Ice Lotus inside him

01:58.350 --> 01:59.280
has completely shattered.

01:59.950 --> 02:00.640
The Ice Lotus?

02:02.640 --> 02:03.950
He consumed half of his Golden Core

02:04.230 --> 02:05.230
to nurture the Reincarnation Tree,

02:05.950 --> 02:07.370
so he had to cultivate the Ice Lotus Technique

02:07.400 --> 02:08.240
to complete the Golden Core.

02:09.240 --> 02:09.750
Now,

02:10.680 --> 02:11.470
with the Ice Lotus Technique broken,

02:11.750 --> 02:13.190
that half of the Golden Core has shattered as well.

02:13.920 --> 02:15.550
So he has fallen from the Transcendence Stage,

02:16.230 --> 02:17.310
and his spiritual power is now imbalanced.

02:18.079 --> 02:18.970
If we don't find a way

02:19.000 --> 02:19.910
to stabilize his spiritual power,

02:20.630 --> 02:21.680
he'll go berserk

02:21.980 --> 02:22.780
and live a life worse than death.

02:23.870 --> 02:25.079
I will find a way to save him.

02:26.240 --> 02:26.800
However,

02:29.310 --> 02:30.490
the hope is faint.

02:42.470 --> 02:43.000
Master,

02:43.520 --> 02:44.910
I'll help you control your spiritual power.

03:08.710 --> 03:09.470
Ling Xiao,

03:09.920 --> 03:11.150
what have you done?

03:33.329 --> 03:33.770
Master...

03:33.800 --> 03:34.240
Don't move.

03:34.840 --> 03:36.520
Your wounds haven't healed. Why are you running around?

03:50.840 --> 03:51.520
Master,

03:52.630 --> 03:53.700
I'll definitely save you.

04:04.450 --> 04:05.290
Master,

04:05.960 --> 04:06.910
I will save you.

04:08.080 --> 04:09.280
I will definitely save you.

04:13.150 --> 04:13.800
Vine,

04:14.410 --> 04:15.020
help me.

04:16.899 --> 04:18.260
I need to enter Master's consciousness.

04:38.530 --> 04:39.300
Master!

04:51.010 --> 04:51.770
Master?

04:52.950 --> 04:53.560
What should I do?

04:55.240 --> 04:57.090
How can I save you?

05:25.310 --> 05:26.920
Master's Ice Lotus Technique is broken,

05:25.690 --> 05:32.390
♫Who knows the loneliness of mountains and seas?♫

05:27.600 --> 05:28.560
and he has fallen from the Transcendence Stage.

05:29.720 --> 05:31.120
That's why he can't control his spiritual power,

05:32.270 --> 05:33.830
leading him to be in such endless pain.

05:32.470 --> 05:38.800
♫The sharp wind cuts at my heart♫

05:36.240 --> 05:36.950
But I am the Reincarnation Fruit

05:36.950 --> 05:38.120
nurtured by Master,

05:38.560 --> 05:39.510
sharing the same origin as him.

05:39.200 --> 05:42.750
♫Hold a drop of blood♫

05:40.390 --> 05:41.560
My primal power

05:41.980 --> 05:43.060
can help Master.

05:43.130 --> 05:46.900
♫Tattered flowers and tears♫

05:47.280 --> 05:52.870
♫Reincarnating but to no avail♫

05:53.610 --> 06:00.220
♫Devoting one's life despite knowing it can't be♫

05:54.680 --> 05:56.000
Master is too weak to respond.

05:56.850 --> 05:58.100
The primal spiritual power can't flow into his body.

06:00.730 --> 06:06.810
♫Coming to the abyss despite knowing retreat is possible♫

06:07.610 --> 06:11.100
♫Who says the world is full of wrongs?♫

06:11.220 --> 06:14.880
♫I seize the Way and choose heaven♫

06:15.850 --> 06:22.560
♫It won't be a waste of my life to burn until I wither♫

06:23.290 --> 06:25.990
♫There's no need to discuss right or wrong♫

06:26.200 --> 06:29.850
♫I can sacrifice my life♫

06:30.260 --> 06:33.130
♫All rules can be dismantled♫

06:33.380 --> 06:36.920
♫Die in this world♫

06:37.680 --> 06:41.240
♫The masses spread rumors that are hard to swallow♫

06:41.880 --> 06:44.700
♫I haven't said anything yet, my heart is clear♫

06:45.220 --> 06:51.200
♫I still don't regret it; I'll pay for it all my life♫

06:51.610 --> 06:54.490
♫You know my heart, won't go against my wishes♫

06:54.560 --> 06:58.090
♫Don't speak of redressing injustices♫

06:58.540 --> 07:00.860
♫Don't let others pity me♫

07:00.880 --> 07:05.340
♫Try your best to forget me♫

07:05.930 --> 07:09.340
♫I'll go through hardships and never break down♫

07:09.620 --> 07:12.790
♫I vow to fight against darkness♫

07:13.290 --> 07:19.710
♫Love punishes me a thousand times, yet a merciful heart pardons me♫

07:19.900 --> 07:26.270
♫Only love is the unbreakable spell♫

07:26.950 --> 07:33.080
♫No need to feel surprised people in the world don't know how to break it♫

07:31.240 --> 07:31.830
It works.

07:32.880 --> 07:34.290
This method works.

07:34.030 --> 07:37.450
♫Sealing your lips, never to speak again♫

07:37.590 --> 07:40.990
♫Even if I were to leap into the abyss♫

07:41.740 --> 07:49.130
♫If you are safe, I would embrace death without a second thought♫

08:01.070 --> 08:01.600
Master!

08:03.160 --> 08:03.630
Master,

08:04.200 --> 08:04.930
your face...

08:07.240 --> 08:07.730
Master,

08:07.830 --> 08:08.720
please get on the carriage first.

08:08.870 --> 08:09.360
I'll cover the rear.

08:23.510 --> 08:24.040
Master!

08:24.950 --> 08:25.430
Master.

08:25.630 --> 08:26.480
Master, are you alright?

08:26.720 --> 08:27.110
Master,

08:27.310 --> 08:28.360
what happened,

08:28.390 --> 08:28.830
Master?

08:29.560 --> 08:30.840
Please forgive me, Master!

08:31.040 --> 08:32.299
Look what you did!

08:32.360 --> 08:33.240
Master, please forgive me!

08:40.909 --> 08:41.630
What is this?

08:43.630 --> 08:45.030
This is the Third Prince's Death Guard Token.

08:45.510 --> 08:46.010
Master,

08:46.300 --> 08:47.600
we have never had any grievances

08:47.600 --> 08:48.150
with the Third Prince.

08:48.390 --> 08:49.630
Why does he want to kill you?

08:49.870 --> 08:51.000
What else could it be?

08:51.750 --> 08:53.390
I've been with the Crown Prince.

08:54.240 --> 08:56.000
His hands have actually reached here.

08:57.080 --> 08:57.790
We'll talk about it when we get back.

08:58.320 --> 08:58.790
Yes.

09:01.640 --> 09:03.630
[Madam Battle's Palace]

09:08.600 --> 09:09.130
Why?

09:11.360 --> 09:12.210
Why can't your medicine

09:12.240 --> 09:13.360
heal my wounds?

09:14.440 --> 09:15.290
It's probably because Wei Jiu

09:15.550 --> 09:16.370
carried poison in his hands.

09:17.030 --> 09:18.390
Damn Wei Jiu.

09:19.120 --> 09:19.960
Master, don't worry.

09:20.840 --> 09:22.020
Give me a bit more time.

09:26.510 --> 09:27.270
Time?

09:29.600 --> 09:30.910
I'm about to get married.

09:31.510 --> 09:33.200
How can I afford to wait?

09:34.320 --> 09:35.360
I've been through a lot

09:36.740 --> 09:37.930
to get this appearance.

09:40.120 --> 09:41.550
Anyway, you need to find a way

09:42.080 --> 09:43.050
to heal me quickly.

09:47.080 --> 09:48.600
Why hasn't Yu come to see me yet?

09:49.310 --> 09:50.120
Didn't I tell you

09:50.150 --> 09:51.120
to go invite him earlier?

09:52.120 --> 09:53.410
Hurry up and send someone to urge him!

09:55.910 --> 09:56.810
Madam Battle,

09:56.890 --> 09:57.770
Wu Mi requests an audience.

09:58.720 --> 09:59.200
Invite him in.

09:59.750 --> 10:00.150
Yes.

10:06.840 --> 10:07.360
Your Highness.

10:08.110 --> 10:08.720
Where is Yu?

10:09.440 --> 10:10.480
His Highness has something urgent to attend to.

10:10.790 --> 10:11.360
Tonight,

10:12.240 --> 10:13.510
I'm afraid he won't be able to come and see you.

10:14.070 --> 10:15.480
Your Highness, please rest and focus on healing.

10:16.870 --> 10:17.720
Does His Highness not know

10:17.720 --> 10:18.480
that I'm injured?

10:20.320 --> 10:20.750
Also,

10:21.330 --> 10:22.550
I was ambushed on the way.

10:22.910 --> 10:24.160
It was the Third Prince's doing.

10:25.030 --> 10:26.550
He is not only targeting me.

10:27.000 --> 10:28.150
I must tell Yu

10:28.840 --> 10:29.790
the details

10:29.790 --> 10:30.770
and remind him to be cautious.

10:31.200 --> 10:31.910
His Highness has said that

10:32.110 --> 10:33.870
the Third Prince and he share a deep brotherly bond.

10:33.870 --> 10:35.270
Your Highness, you should not jump to conclusions.

10:35.510 --> 10:36.510
He will investigate it thoroughly.

10:36.870 --> 10:37.800
Once the truth is uncovered,

10:37.910 --> 10:39.240
His Highness will seek justice for you.

10:39.840 --> 10:40.270
Also,

10:40.960 --> 10:41.750
His Highness said that

10:42.120 --> 10:43.200
due to your facial injury,

10:43.720 --> 10:44.790
the wedding will be postponed

10:45.120 --> 10:45.720
and discussed in the future.

10:49.030 --> 10:50.630
What does he mean by that?

10:52.290 --> 10:53.290
Does it mean that as long as

10:53.320 --> 10:54.000
my face is injured,

10:54.480 --> 10:55.630
he won't marry me?

10:57.750 --> 10:58.270
No.

10:59.200 --> 11:00.360
I must go and talk it through with His Highness.

11:00.390 --> 11:00.840
Your Highness.

11:01.270 --> 11:02.550
The Crown Prince has been worried about His Majesty's health

11:02.550 --> 11:03.240
for many days.

11:03.240 --> 11:04.080
But you haven't made

11:05.130 --> 11:06.390
another Health Pill

11:06.390 --> 11:07.000
that he asked for.

11:09.600 --> 11:11.120
The Crown Prince has long had no energy for anything else.

11:11.960 --> 11:12.910
Your Highness, please understand.

11:25.200 --> 11:26.120
Madam Battle,

11:26.510 --> 11:28.120
Concubine Zhou heard that you were injured

11:28.390 --> 11:29.360
and sent over a bottle of secret medicine.

11:29.790 --> 11:31.930
She said it was made from the secret formula

11:31.960 --> 11:33.270
you once gave her,

11:33.550 --> 11:34.980
and it's very effective for injuries

11:35.200 --> 11:36.000
caused by magic.

11:37.030 --> 11:38.360
She hopes it can help you recover.

11:38.870 --> 11:39.630
Tell her to get lost!

11:40.270 --> 11:41.080
Your Highness, please calm down!

11:41.440 --> 11:42.320
All of you, get out!

11:47.150 --> 11:47.960
Master.

11:48.550 --> 11:49.080
She can't wait for me

11:49.080 --> 11:50.600
to lose favor with the Crown Prince.

11:51.750 --> 11:53.120
How could she possibly send anything good?

11:55.270 --> 11:56.240
That bitch.

11:57.150 --> 11:58.390
Trying to use this opportunity to climb up?

12:00.270 --> 12:01.870
She's way too eager.

12:04.270 --> 12:06.080
A mere Health Pill

12:07.630 --> 12:08.510
won't stop me.

12:10.510 --> 12:12.000
I'll definitely make

12:13.780 --> 12:14.930
another Health Pill.

12:16.750 --> 12:17.390
Wang Suizhi,

12:18.170 --> 12:19.400
have you found the Ghost Grass

12:19.630 --> 12:20.200
I asked you to search for?

12:21.360 --> 12:22.000
Master,

12:22.840 --> 12:23.960
you used to not allow us

12:24.150 --> 12:25.290
to use that kind of herb

12:26.120 --> 12:26.720
that boosts

12:27.200 --> 12:28.510
spiritual power in a short time.

12:29.510 --> 12:30.480
It's highly depleting

12:31.030 --> 12:32.180
and can easily backfire.

12:33.150 --> 12:34.670
It's not a long-term solution.

12:35.360 --> 12:35.870
Give it to me!

12:37.720 --> 12:38.270
Master,

12:39.440 --> 12:40.510
please listen to my advice.

12:42.120 --> 12:43.240
Leave the palace.

12:44.600 --> 12:45.570
Don't force yourself to break through

12:45.870 --> 12:47.080
for Su Yu anymore.

12:48.550 --> 12:49.320
He's not worth it.

12:50.630 --> 12:51.510
Who do you think you are

12:51.960 --> 12:52.960
to tell me whether he's worth it or not?

12:53.790 --> 12:54.720
This time, while I was

12:55.240 --> 12:57.000
searching for the Ghost Grass to help you advance,

12:57.910 --> 12:58.790
I found that

12:59.870 --> 13:01.150
Wu Mi was also looking for it.

13:01.910 --> 13:03.390
Not only does this herb enhance one's power,

13:03.960 --> 13:05.270
but it also has detoxifying effects.

13:06.690 --> 13:07.790
Out of curiosity,

13:08.790 --> 13:09.790
I followed the guard

13:10.520 --> 13:12.000
and sneaked into the Crown Prince's palace.

13:16.790 --> 13:17.720
I saw that

13:33.970 --> 13:35.650
he had long been severely poisoned

13:36.600 --> 13:37.480
and didn't have much time left.

13:38.600 --> 13:40.120
I dug deeper into this matter.

13:41.160 --> 13:41.870
Do you know

13:42.720 --> 13:43.720
who poisoned him?

13:44.510 --> 13:46.030
It was the Second Prince,

13:46.240 --> 13:47.510
the one you saved from Su Yishui

13:48.320 --> 13:49.840
many years ago.

13:50.750 --> 13:51.670
Did that Second Prince

13:52.420 --> 13:53.570
die long ago?

13:53.840 --> 13:54.630
That's right.

13:55.260 --> 13:56.690
So Su Yu must have been poisoned

13:57.080 --> 13:58.550
more than 10 years ago.

13:59.000 --> 13:59.670
The Health Pill

13:59.670 --> 14:01.150
was never for the Emperor.

14:01.840 --> 14:02.670
Obviously, the Crown Prince

14:02.670 --> 14:03.820
wants it made for his own use.

14:04.480 --> 14:05.480
Master, if you can't make

14:05.500 --> 14:06.690
a high-quality Health Pill,

14:07.670 --> 14:08.910
how can you be of any use to him?

14:09.750 --> 14:11.120
Under the power of the throne,

14:11.240 --> 14:12.320
how can there be true love?

14:13.200 --> 14:14.840
He has long since become a man

14:15.080 --> 14:16.150
of schemes and calculations,

14:17.240 --> 14:18.240
no longer

14:19.060 --> 14:20.990
the Yu that you cared about.

14:22.600 --> 14:23.260
Impossible.

14:26.710 --> 14:27.630
He loves me.

14:29.790 --> 14:30.510
He waited for me for 18 years

14:30.510 --> 14:32.270
with the position of Crown Princess vacant.

14:34.910 --> 14:36.320
He would never scheme against me.

14:39.750 --> 14:40.670
Master!

14:41.190 --> 14:42.510
If he truly loved you,

14:42.870 --> 14:44.120
how would he widely spread the news

14:44.150 --> 14:45.550
of you going to the Marrow-Cleansing Pool?

14:46.000 --> 14:47.120
He only intentionally let the rumor slip

14:47.120 --> 14:48.150
to the Third Prince,

14:48.630 --> 14:49.390
making you the target

14:49.510 --> 14:50.000
for all kinds of attacks,

14:50.000 --> 14:51.600
acting as his shield.

14:51.630 --> 14:52.320
Enough!

14:55.030 --> 14:56.120
Even so,

14:57.030 --> 14:58.120
it's even more impossible for me to leave.

15:01.550 --> 15:03.030
As long as I'm strong enough,

15:04.140 --> 15:05.500
Su Yu won't be able to leave me.

15:06.920 --> 15:08.260
I will win his heart sooner or later.

15:14.230 --> 15:15.500
In this life,

15:17.390 --> 15:19.480
I haven't enjoyed enough wealth and glory.

15:21.500 --> 15:22.610
It's just a Health Pill.

15:24.080 --> 15:26.030
The Mu Qingge from the last life could make it,

15:26.840 --> 15:30.150
and the Mu Qingge now can do the same.

15:31.680 --> 15:33.040
I will restore my spiritual power

15:34.600 --> 15:35.650
and help him detoxify.

15:37.030 --> 15:38.080
Master!

15:38.150 --> 15:39.030
Say no more.

15:40.870 --> 15:42.870
Find everything I need right away.

15:43.810 --> 15:45.700
In this life, I was born with Five Spirit Roots.

15:47.000 --> 15:48.080
Heaven is on my side.

15:50.040 --> 15:51.710
I will never leave Su Yu,

15:53.790 --> 15:55.550
and I will never let anyone take the position

15:56.910 --> 15:58.750
of Crown Princess from me.

16:34.840 --> 16:35.360
Master,

16:35.790 --> 16:36.440
you're awake?

16:37.110 --> 16:37.920
Are you still feeling unwell?

16:39.030 --> 16:40.300
Master, do you need to use the restroom?

16:40.830 --> 16:41.690
Let me help you.

16:42.320 --> 16:42.840
No need.

16:43.370 --> 16:44.220
Let me help you.

16:44.670 --> 16:45.310
Get out!

16:47.630 --> 16:48.840
Master, your wounds haven't fully healed yet.

16:49.270 --> 16:50.150
I must stay by your side.

16:52.510 --> 16:53.840
I am no longer your master,

16:54.600 --> 16:56.000
and I don't need an outsider to take care of me.

16:56.480 --> 16:57.790
Why are you still here at Mount Wester?

16:58.600 --> 16:59.790
I won't leave you,

17:00.200 --> 17:01.200
and I won't leave Mount Wester.

17:03.080 --> 17:03.970
Once you're recovered,

17:04.190 --> 17:05.190
I'll go find Liang Wumeng.

17:05.630 --> 17:06.460
I will definitely find a way

17:06.510 --> 17:07.440
to return Ling Xiao to you.

17:08.400 --> 17:09.550
Haven't you already discovered my identity

17:09.550 --> 17:10.589
in the Memory Cave?

17:11.550 --> 17:12.680
Why do you still dare to stay here?

17:13.109 --> 17:14.589
Aren't you afraid I'll kill you to silence you?

17:15.670 --> 17:16.300
I'm not afraid.

17:17.170 --> 17:18.440
No matter who you are,

17:18.460 --> 17:19.089
I know

17:19.400 --> 17:20.480
you would never harm me.

17:21.680 --> 17:22.640
I've finally realized that

17:23.349 --> 17:24.430
your Ice Lotus Technique

17:24.680 --> 17:26.000
only freezes yourself,

17:26.480 --> 17:27.640
and your Unfeeling Mantra

17:27.950 --> 17:29.190
is also only ruthless toward yourself.

17:33.510 --> 17:35.030
You've done so much for me,

17:35.720 --> 17:36.880
yet told me nothing.

17:39.750 --> 17:40.830
I've been thinking about it for a long time.

17:41.640 --> 17:42.160
Master,

17:43.160 --> 17:43.960
may I have

17:43.960 --> 17:44.830
the boldness to say

17:46.070 --> 17:46.960
that you have feelings for me?

17:48.790 --> 17:49.550
Your little disciple

17:49.550 --> 17:50.650
knows you're the Demon's child

17:50.680 --> 17:51.720
but doesn't despise you.

17:53.070 --> 17:53.750
Release me.

17:54.460 --> 17:55.650
Let me enter your heart

17:55.680 --> 17:56.680
and help you keep her.

17:59.170 --> 18:00.680
What are you waiting for?

18:01.150 --> 18:02.220
Don't you want her?

18:02.880 --> 18:04.720
Can you bear to let her go in this lifetime?

18:05.920 --> 18:07.040
Let me help you.

18:07.070 --> 18:07.640
Shut up!

18:08.470 --> 18:09.470
Master, what's wrong?

18:09.960 --> 18:10.880
Does it hurt anywhere?

18:11.790 --> 18:14.000
Who taught you to talk to yourself like this?

18:14.830 --> 18:16.510
I've despised you, this rebellious disciple, for a long time.

18:17.240 --> 18:18.110
I was afraid you wouldn't make it out

18:18.110 --> 18:19.200
of Heavenly Meridian Mountain in one piece,

18:19.790 --> 18:20.790
that you'd get trapped at Mount Wester

18:21.160 --> 18:22.360
and cause me lifelong annoyance,

18:22.550 --> 18:23.510
which is why I helped you.

18:24.030 --> 18:25.350
It was simply my own miscalculation

18:26.460 --> 18:27.550
that caused my technique to become ineffective,

18:27.880 --> 18:29.210
so I failed in detaching myself

18:29.240 --> 18:30.310
from the White Tiger in time.

18:30.960 --> 18:32.310
Who would have known you were so useless,

18:32.650 --> 18:33.650
dragging me down to this point?

18:34.030 --> 18:35.070
If I had known you would have

18:35.070 --> 18:35.750
such foolish thoughts,

18:36.070 --> 18:37.160
I wouldn't have helped you.

18:37.750 --> 18:38.350
As expected,

18:39.210 --> 18:40.280
you're going to say these hurtful things

18:40.310 --> 18:42.030
that you don't really mean again.

18:42.680 --> 18:43.830
Do you think I will believe you?

18:44.620 --> 18:46.100
If someone despises another person,

18:46.480 --> 18:47.990
how could they possibly sacrifice a piece of their soul

18:48.070 --> 18:48.960
to protect them?

18:49.790 --> 18:50.240
Master,

18:50.630 --> 18:52.000
if you want to pretend to be cold and heartless,

18:52.030 --> 18:53.030
at least try to make it convincing.

18:53.840 --> 18:54.410
If, in the past,

18:54.440 --> 18:55.480
it was because I was too weak,

18:55.980 --> 18:56.610
now I have formed

18:56.640 --> 18:57.550
my Golden Core.

18:58.510 --> 18:59.680
Whatever happens,

19:00.070 --> 19:01.030
we can face it together.

19:04.120 --> 19:05.280
Do you know why

19:05.310 --> 19:06.480
I care for you so much?

19:07.960 --> 19:08.510
Why?

19:09.720 --> 19:10.900
Of course, it's because of Mu Qingge.

19:14.310 --> 19:15.400
Haven't you already realized

19:16.110 --> 19:17.240
how deeply I love her?

19:21.410 --> 19:22.280
It's just that she doesn't know

19:22.310 --> 19:23.200
my feelings for her.

19:25.510 --> 19:26.920
She was always a bleeding heart,

19:27.960 --> 19:29.180
foolishly trying to save everyone.

19:30.340 --> 19:31.550
She even risked her life

19:32.650 --> 19:34.340
to help a rebellious disciple like me.

19:40.000 --> 19:41.440
But before she died, she told me

19:42.510 --> 19:44.210
that she never wanted to see me again, alive or dead.

19:44.750 --> 19:45.480
What could I do?

19:46.480 --> 19:47.400
I could only prove to her

19:47.400 --> 19:48.550
that I could be a good person.

19:49.590 --> 19:51.270
That's why I've been taking such good care of you.

19:52.100 --> 19:53.280
She was always so loyal

19:53.880 --> 19:55.350
and selfless toward her disciples.

19:58.400 --> 19:58.970
I can only do

19:59.000 --> 20:00.160
what she wanted me to do,

20:02.000 --> 20:03.440
in the hope of

20:03.910 --> 20:04.920
regaining a place in her heart.

20:09.160 --> 20:09.790
Master,

20:11.140 --> 20:11.900
I don't believe

20:12.830 --> 20:14.200
that none of what you did for me

20:14.680 --> 20:15.790
was out of love.

20:18.030 --> 20:18.550
No.

20:26.690 --> 20:27.520
If what I did for you

20:27.550 --> 20:28.750
made you develop

20:29.160 --> 20:30.110
inappropriate expectations,

20:32.350 --> 20:33.000
then let me

20:33.030 --> 20:34.350
make it clear to you today:

20:36.000 --> 20:37.510
In my heart, whether in the past or the future,

20:38.070 --> 20:39.550
there is only Mu Qingge,

20:40.120 --> 20:40.960
and never you.

20:44.110 --> 20:45.310
But you know very well

20:45.640 --> 20:46.440
that Master Mu

20:46.440 --> 20:47.680
is not Mu Qingge.

20:48.790 --> 20:50.510
Whether she is real or fake, I can judge for myself.

20:51.200 --> 20:52.270
This is between me and her,

20:52.680 --> 20:53.680
and it's none of your business.

21:02.240 --> 21:03.510
When I took you as my disciple,

21:04.070 --> 21:05.160
it was only because I pitied you.

21:06.240 --> 21:07.680
I've fulfilled my duties as a master,

21:08.510 --> 21:09.000
and you should

21:09.030 --> 21:10.030
know your place as a disciple.

21:14.640 --> 21:15.480
If you're going to have

21:15.550 --> 21:16.440
such inappropriate expectations again,

21:16.720 --> 21:17.790
then get out of my Wester Sect.

21:24.510 --> 21:25.750
Your constantly changing attitude

21:26.690 --> 21:27.820
is so confusing.

21:28.750 --> 21:30.270
But if you say everything you did

21:31.140 --> 21:32.580
was just out of duty as my master,

21:33.160 --> 21:34.400
I will never believe it.

21:34.780 --> 21:35.780
Whether you believe it or not is up to you.

21:36.550 --> 21:37.070
Get out.

21:37.750 --> 21:39.000
Don't delay my healing.

21:56.790 --> 21:58.450
Do you think saying such harsh words to her

21:58.480 --> 21:59.690
will stop your little disciple

21:59.720 --> 22:00.350
from having

22:00.370 --> 22:02.160
deep affection for you?

22:03.920 --> 22:06.110
You were never a good person to begin with.

22:07.550 --> 22:09.550
What's wrong with following your own desires

22:09.550 --> 22:10.590
and ambitions?

22:11.270 --> 22:12.920
Why do you suppress yourself?

22:13.480 --> 22:15.070
Self-restraint is the most painful.

22:15.620 --> 22:16.640
By sealing me,

22:16.790 --> 22:18.750
you're sealing your true self.

22:20.070 --> 22:21.960
After all, you've already fallen from the Transcendence Realm.

22:22.550 --> 22:23.270
Su Yishui,

22:24.000 --> 22:26.000
sealing me will kill you.

22:26.680 --> 22:28.400
Aren't you afraid of death?

22:52.070 --> 22:53.240
I'm afraid this bottle won't be able to contain

22:53.240 --> 22:54.110
the Spirit Spring for long.

22:55.200 --> 22:56.240
I don't have much time left.

22:57.200 --> 22:58.240
I must recover quickly

22:59.000 --> 23:00.230
and obtain the Xuantian Teachings.

23:18.160 --> 23:18.680
Ranran.

23:21.830 --> 23:22.720
Mr. Zeng.

23:24.440 --> 23:25.200
Why are you crying?

23:26.160 --> 23:27.000
Did he scold you?

23:27.510 --> 23:27.920
Mr. Zeng,

23:29.000 --> 23:29.790
I already know it.

23:31.790 --> 23:33.310
Ling Xiao is Master's spiritual soul.

23:34.320 --> 23:35.480
You must have known about it long ago, right?

23:37.720 --> 23:38.240
Well...

23:38.510 --> 23:39.240
I can feel that

23:39.240 --> 23:40.880
Master has been hiding many things from me.

23:41.550 --> 23:42.480
I know if I asked you,

23:42.480 --> 23:43.580
you wouldn't tell me either.

23:44.410 --> 23:45.610
But I absolutely won't

23:45.640 --> 23:46.590
leave the Wester Sect at this time.

23:47.200 --> 23:48.480
I'm going to write to Liang Wumeng now

23:48.680 --> 23:50.310
and ask him for the method to return the spiritual soul.

23:51.680 --> 23:52.640
It's been 19 years.

23:53.070 --> 23:54.070
There's no such method.

23:54.640 --> 23:55.400
Even if there was,

23:56.130 --> 23:56.610
the cost

23:56.640 --> 23:57.790
would be something you can't bear.

23:58.350 --> 23:59.680
Since your Master gave it to you,

24:00.000 --> 24:01.110
he never intended to take it back.

24:02.790 --> 24:04.310
But that was Master's kindness.

24:04.640 --> 24:05.720
I can't just accept it

24:05.750 --> 24:06.480
without doing anything.

24:07.380 --> 24:08.420
He always arranges things for me

24:08.750 --> 24:09.350
and takes care of me.

24:09.920 --> 24:11.240
But I've grown up now.

24:11.750 --> 24:13.000
I want to take care of him too.

24:13.270 --> 24:14.610
I want to stand by his side,

24:14.750 --> 24:15.880
shielding him from storms.

24:16.270 --> 24:17.240
That's what he owes you.

24:17.480 --> 24:18.400
He should do that.

24:23.200 --> 24:23.790
Anyway,

24:24.510 --> 24:25.830
it's natural for a master

24:26.160 --> 24:27.200
to take care of his disciple.

24:27.720 --> 24:28.680
Don't overthink it.

24:30.960 --> 24:31.830
But does he really

24:32.680 --> 24:34.480
only have the duty of a master towards me?

24:38.090 --> 24:39.730
What if I want more?

24:42.200 --> 24:42.880
Mr. Zeng,

24:43.760 --> 24:45.080
I've developed a greedy thought.

24:49.640 --> 24:50.200
Mr. Zeng,

24:50.880 --> 24:51.880
what kind of person

24:51.880 --> 24:52.590
is Mu Qingge really?

24:53.310 --> 24:54.400
Why is Master

24:54.400 --> 24:55.400
so obsessed with her?

24:57.990 --> 24:59.470
She is an extremely good person.

25:00.070 --> 25:00.730
So are you.

25:01.350 --> 25:02.260
You deserve better.

25:02.960 --> 25:04.400
But I don't want better.

25:05.790 --> 25:07.440
If Master keeps waiting and Master Mu doesn't come,

25:08.440 --> 25:09.270
maybe someday

25:10.110 --> 25:11.350
he will notice me, right?

25:37.510 --> 25:38.680
Congratulations,

25:39.110 --> 25:40.400
My Lord.

25:43.310 --> 25:43.830
My Lord,

25:44.200 --> 25:45.200
since you returned from the Black Pool,

25:45.270 --> 25:46.650
not only have you restored your previous spiritual power

25:46.960 --> 25:48.510
but also reached the peak of the Nascent Soul Realm.

25:49.350 --> 25:50.480
If it hadn't been

25:50.480 --> 25:51.960
for Mu Qingge's ambush,

25:52.590 --> 25:54.240
I would have only become stronger.

25:55.510 --> 25:56.310
Unfortunately,

25:57.000 --> 25:58.030
I didn't get the Spirit Spring,

25:58.930 --> 26:00.680
so I still can't open Mount Red Flame.

26:03.240 --> 26:04.110
Where is Tu Jiuyuan?

26:04.880 --> 26:06.270
Why didn't she come to welcome me?

26:07.310 --> 26:08.070
My Lord,

26:08.720 --> 26:09.350
since Su Yishui

26:09.350 --> 26:10.680
injured her Spirit Root

26:10.680 --> 26:11.640
last time,

26:12.350 --> 26:13.400
Elder Tu hasn't fully recovered yet.

26:14.030 --> 26:14.920
Recently,

26:15.680 --> 26:16.790
some of her old ailments have resurfaced.

26:27.350 --> 26:27.830
My Lord.

26:28.240 --> 26:28.790
My Lord.

26:31.870 --> 26:32.740
Did you do this on purpose?

26:33.550 --> 26:34.440
When did you become

26:34.440 --> 26:35.400
so vulnerable?

26:48.480 --> 26:49.200
What is this?

26:52.200 --> 26:52.830
Water from the Black Pool.

26:55.160 --> 26:56.590
The entire mountain's spiritual vein has collapsed.

26:57.310 --> 26:57.960
No one stopped me,

26:57.960 --> 26:58.920
so I brought it out.

27:02.830 --> 27:03.790
You're lucky.

27:04.680 --> 27:05.510
Once you gather enough spiritual power

27:05.510 --> 27:06.400
to deal with Su Yishui,

27:07.030 --> 27:07.680
don't

27:09.330 --> 27:10.280
let yourself

27:10.310 --> 27:11.270
get almost killed again.

27:18.000 --> 27:18.790
Thank you, My Lord.

27:20.510 --> 27:22.480
When His Lordship came out of the Black Pool,

27:22.920 --> 27:24.110
he was already at his peak.

27:25.070 --> 27:26.110
Why did he have to take the water

27:26.110 --> 27:27.350
from the Marrow-Cleansing Pool?

27:28.880 --> 27:29.510
Looks like

27:29.950 --> 27:31.310
this water was brought back

27:31.310 --> 27:32.150
specifically for you.

27:34.310 --> 27:35.070
There's something

27:35.440 --> 27:37.070
I'm not sure if I should say.

27:38.160 --> 27:38.920
Elder,

27:39.200 --> 27:40.830
why do you always have to meet force with force?

27:42.680 --> 27:43.960
You mean...

27:44.750 --> 27:45.560
If you

27:45.590 --> 27:46.940
want to achieve your goal,

27:47.680 --> 27:48.880
you should be gentler.

27:49.920 --> 27:50.920
It's better to use softness to overcome strength

27:51.600 --> 27:52.990
than to confront head-on.

28:05.920 --> 28:06.440
Elder Tu.

28:09.750 --> 28:10.240
My Lord.

28:16.640 --> 28:17.310
Guards!

28:18.070 --> 28:19.180
Which blind fool

28:19.310 --> 28:20.200
mistook Illusion Liquid for wine

28:20.200 --> 28:21.680
and served it to me again?

28:22.070 --> 28:23.400
Why did I see someone

28:23.420 --> 28:24.500
who looks like Elder Tu again?

28:25.550 --> 28:26.590
My Lord, you're not mistaken.

28:27.070 --> 28:27.750
It is me.

28:36.680 --> 28:38.160
Why are you dressed like this?

28:42.960 --> 28:44.720
I used the Black Pool water you gave me,

28:45.110 --> 28:46.200
and my internal injuries have healed.

28:47.250 --> 28:49.100
I specifically came to thank you.

28:50.310 --> 28:51.030
Is that so?

28:54.440 --> 28:56.030
But why do

28:56.640 --> 28:58.590
your lips look much redder

28:59.400 --> 29:00.510
and your face much paler than usual?

29:01.480 --> 29:02.720
You look like you've been poisoned.

29:05.310 --> 29:05.960
My Lord,

29:06.380 --> 29:07.950
Elder just applied some rouge.

29:12.550 --> 29:14.480
I made some desserts,

29:15.030 --> 29:16.550
all of which you used to like.

29:22.480 --> 29:23.200
Alright.

29:24.260 --> 29:26.130
Now that you're recovered, don't delay your work.

29:26.480 --> 29:27.200
Usually,

29:27.400 --> 29:29.270
you're not one for formalities.

29:30.070 --> 29:31.640
Just kill a few more people for me.

29:34.070 --> 29:35.510
Making desserts?

29:36.720 --> 29:37.880
That's not like you at all.

29:39.550 --> 29:41.160
I used to make them for you in the past.

29:42.640 --> 29:43.480
When we were little,

29:43.790 --> 29:45.600
you liked the fennel cakes from the shop at the foot of the mountain.

29:47.270 --> 29:48.440
Back then, every time you got punished,

29:48.750 --> 29:50.310
you asked Senior Sister to take you to eat them.

29:51.480 --> 29:53.160
Later, that shop moved,

29:53.790 --> 29:54.920
so I learned to make them myself.

29:57.310 --> 29:57.960
Is that so?

30:00.880 --> 30:03.070
Why don't I remember that I like them?

30:05.110 --> 30:06.310
Times change.

30:07.610 --> 30:08.720
Over time,

30:09.900 --> 30:11.200
people always change.

30:18.960 --> 30:20.160
That's right.

30:21.240 --> 30:22.030
Speaking of which,

30:22.440 --> 30:23.750
the Mu Qingge from before

30:24.200 --> 30:25.680
was so spirited

30:25.790 --> 30:26.750
and unique.

30:28.030 --> 30:29.550
But the Mu Qingge now

30:30.230 --> 30:31.670
only has a shell,

30:32.030 --> 30:33.720
and has become vulgar, dull,

30:33.750 --> 30:34.680
malicious, and despicable.

30:35.300 --> 30:36.300
So disappointing.

30:39.600 --> 30:41.160
My Lord, it's good that you can see

30:41.310 --> 30:42.310
her true color.

30:44.270 --> 30:46.560
In comparison, that disciple of Su Yishui

30:47.550 --> 30:49.240
suits my taste quite well.

30:50.270 --> 30:52.640
She has some of the charm that Mu Qingge used to have.

30:54.810 --> 30:57.130
Prepare some gifts and send them to Ranran.

30:57.720 --> 30:59.030
The Wester Sect is quite austere,

30:59.310 --> 31:00.480
so there probably aren't many good things.

31:00.790 --> 31:02.160
She should be easy to win over.

31:02.920 --> 31:03.960
These fennel cakes are a good choice.

31:04.790 --> 31:05.640
Take some to her.

31:08.590 --> 31:10.500
She's from a righteous sect.

31:11.350 --> 31:12.510
She might not be used to the desserts

31:12.510 --> 31:13.790
of a demonic cultivator like you.

31:14.880 --> 31:16.510
Righteous sect?

31:17.070 --> 31:18.550
Once I destroy it, it will be nothing.

31:19.750 --> 31:22.030
This time, after Su Yishui returned from the Marrow-Cleansing Pool,

31:22.590 --> 31:23.640
his cultivation was damaged.

31:23.880 --> 31:25.880
He won't be able to suppress the Spirit Spring for long.

31:26.550 --> 31:27.960
He will definitely be eager

31:27.980 --> 31:29.190
to find the gate to the netherworld.

31:30.270 --> 31:30.960
At that time,

31:30.980 --> 31:33.350
I'll be waiting for him,

31:33.750 --> 31:35.590
and I'll kill him, the sovereign of the Wester Sect.

31:36.920 --> 31:37.830
By then,

31:38.170 --> 31:40.690
the Spirit Spring and his beautiful disciple

31:41.110 --> 31:42.960
will both be in my grasp.

31:47.030 --> 31:47.830
Where are you going?

31:49.580 --> 31:50.970
Aren't you here to drink with me?

31:51.440 --> 31:53.110
My Lord, you should savor

31:53.750 --> 31:55.350
your grand ambitions on your own.

32:03.350 --> 32:04.270
What's wrong with her?

32:05.070 --> 32:05.790
Isn't this

32:05.810 --> 32:07.420
a perfect way to enrage Su Yishui?

32:17.720 --> 32:19.200
With the moonlight by the window,

32:19.310 --> 32:20.400
in moments of restlessness,

32:20.790 --> 32:22.830
I often think of the sweet potato chips

32:22.910 --> 32:24.750
you gave me.

32:25.440 --> 32:26.550
I'm deeply grateful.

32:27.310 --> 32:28.830
Therefore, I'm returning the favor with a generous gift.

32:29.200 --> 32:31.350
I'm also worried that your fair skin might be left with scars

32:31.370 --> 32:33.280
from the Devourer Bugs,

32:33.590 --> 32:36.110
so I'm sending you some miraculous medicine from the Scarlet Sect.

32:36.490 --> 32:37.650
I hope that when we see each other again,

32:37.680 --> 32:39.510
you will still be as beautiful as before.

32:40.040 --> 32:41.940
There are 10 poems I wrote along with all these things.

32:42.310 --> 32:43.720
I hope you will accept them.

32:45.370 --> 32:46.240
Wei Jiu.

32:54.960 --> 32:55.550
Ranran,

32:56.220 --> 32:58.130
the poems from Sovereign Wei are all love poems.

32:58.480 --> 32:59.310
What is he up to?

33:00.880 --> 33:01.960
Are you stupid?

33:03.310 --> 33:04.550
Isn't it obvious

33:04.680 --> 33:05.920
that he has fallen for our Junior?

33:08.880 --> 33:11.510
The pills he sent are all good ones.

33:11.830 --> 33:14.240
It seems Sovereign Wei has really gone all out.

33:15.160 --> 33:15.960
Ranran,

33:16.560 --> 33:17.210
how do you plan

33:17.510 --> 33:19.030
to handle these things?

33:19.400 --> 33:20.550
Just burn them.

33:24.340 --> 33:24.970
Ranran,

33:25.260 --> 33:27.350
you smell like you're in a hurry.

33:28.030 --> 33:28.750
What's wrong?

33:29.640 --> 33:30.640
Master told me

33:30.900 --> 33:32.450
not to reveal his injuries to anyone

33:32.750 --> 33:34.030
to avoid causing panic.

33:36.310 --> 33:37.510
Master is a little exhausted

33:37.880 --> 33:39.440
from protecting us from the sword formation.

33:39.620 --> 33:40.580
Don't worry.

33:41.450 --> 33:43.050
If there's any letter from Master Liang,

33:43.180 --> 33:44.900
you must inform me right away.

33:46.350 --> 33:47.310
Here's a letter.

33:47.610 --> 33:48.570
It's for Master.

33:49.240 --> 33:50.070
It should be

33:50.210 --> 33:51.070
from Su Yu.

33:54.720 --> 33:55.940
I'll go take it to Master.

34:05.640 --> 34:06.400
Burn them?

34:10.030 --> 34:10.630
Burn them.

34:12.060 --> 34:12.659
Master.

34:14.400 --> 34:15.070
Master?

34:39.360 --> 34:41.190
The Soul Control Technique is so draining.

34:41.480 --> 34:42.150
Will there be

34:42.150 --> 34:43.190
any side effects?

34:44.800 --> 34:46.360
The person who uses the Soul Control Technique

34:46.670 --> 34:47.510
stores their soul

34:47.510 --> 34:48.840
in a spiritual beast's body,

34:49.320 --> 34:50.570
so within a month,

34:50.800 --> 34:52.190
they are often possessed by the spiritual beast.

34:52.719 --> 34:53.290
Sometimes,

34:53.320 --> 34:54.030
they'll also retain

34:54.030 --> 34:54.920
some of the spiritual beast's habits.

34:55.590 --> 34:56.880
Don't be scared if you see that.

34:58.230 --> 34:59.710
So it's the side effect acting up.

35:04.800 --> 35:05.590
Master.

35:11.150 --> 35:12.600
Do you want me to scratch you

35:12.630 --> 35:13.760
like I did to Bai?

35:18.100 --> 35:18.850
Do you like it,

35:18.980 --> 35:19.460
Master?

35:21.930 --> 35:23.410
I prefer you like this.

35:24.150 --> 35:25.840
Not keeping people at arm's length at all.

35:31.190 --> 35:32.250
Master, are you hungry?

35:32.880 --> 35:34.150
I've made something delicious for you.

35:34.710 --> 35:35.960
I originally thought you'd

35:35.960 --> 35:37.400
throw me out along with the bowls.

35:46.330 --> 35:46.800
Here.

36:17.440 --> 36:18.320
When did you come in?

36:19.550 --> 36:20.180
Master,

36:20.760 --> 36:21.790
when I came in just now,

36:21.960 --> 36:23.670
I saw Bai possess you again.

36:24.360 --> 36:25.440
You wanted me to pet you,

36:25.800 --> 36:26.320
so I...

36:26.630 --> 36:27.400
Didn't I tell you

36:27.400 --> 36:28.240
to stay away from me?

36:28.920 --> 36:30.070
Are you ignoring my words?

36:30.510 --> 36:31.960
Well, just consider me a rebellious disciple.

36:33.480 --> 36:34.360
Mr. Zeng said that

36:34.760 --> 36:35.510
in these days,

36:35.680 --> 36:36.640
you would experience the side effects

36:36.670 --> 36:37.930
of the Soul Control Technique just like you did just now

36:38.360 --> 36:40.000
and act like a little tiger sometimes.

36:40.510 --> 36:41.710
Your rebellious disciple has to stay by your side,

36:41.960 --> 36:42.920
scratching you

36:43.030 --> 36:43.920
and smoothing your fur.

36:44.280 --> 36:44.630
You...

36:44.920 --> 36:45.880
Master, are you hungry?

36:46.190 --> 36:47.180
Do you want to eat the food

36:47.280 --> 36:48.110
your rebellious disciple made for you?

36:49.880 --> 36:50.510
Xue Ranran,

36:51.030 --> 36:51.550
don't think

36:51.550 --> 36:52.710
I can't bring myself to punish you.

36:57.110 --> 36:57.630
Master,

36:58.210 --> 36:59.420
for what reason are you going to punish me?

37:00.280 --> 37:01.480
For liking you?

37:03.030 --> 37:03.710
I've flipped through

37:03.710 --> 37:04.960
the Wester Sect rules overnight,

37:05.400 --> 37:06.630
not a single one says

37:06.710 --> 37:08.280
you can't have feelings for your own master.

37:11.190 --> 37:11.880
Besides,

37:12.360 --> 37:12.960
isn't our Wester Sect

37:12.960 --> 37:14.150
known for producing rebellious disciples?

37:14.710 --> 37:15.840
Master, I think

37:16.030 --> 37:17.450
you were quite similar to me back then.

37:20.800 --> 37:22.710
Since your heart already belongs to someone else,

37:23.030 --> 37:23.880
that means I came too late.

37:24.280 --> 37:24.800
I accept that.

37:25.450 --> 37:26.450
But I can't

37:26.480 --> 37:27.420
take you out

37:27.450 --> 37:28.200
of my heart.

37:30.890 --> 37:32.080
Because of Master Mu's

37:32.110 --> 37:32.800
kindness to you,

37:33.160 --> 37:34.380
you are deeply in love with her;

37:35.030 --> 37:36.320
that's your fate with her.

37:37.570 --> 37:39.130
I developed feelings for you

37:39.670 --> 37:41.030
through our time together;

37:41.630 --> 37:43.230
that's my fate with you.

37:45.030 --> 37:46.070
From the moment you abducted me up the mountain,

37:46.070 --> 37:47.030
on the very first day, you said that

37:47.590 --> 37:48.960
the Wester Sect has its own way,

37:49.440 --> 37:50.800
and I should follow my way.

37:51.550 --> 37:52.670
I listened to you.

37:53.710 --> 37:54.840
You have your own convictions,

37:55.110 --> 37:56.440
and I have mine.

37:56.880 --> 37:57.710
You're holding onto yours,

37:58.030 --> 37:58.960
and I'm holding onto mine.

37:59.590 --> 38:00.590
We have a long future ahead.

38:01.190 --> 38:02.190
I won't give up.

38:02.680 --> 38:04.560
You can control everything, including your disciples,

38:04.710 --> 38:05.960
but you can't control what's in my heart.

38:12.480 --> 38:13.630
Master, what's wrong with your eyes?

38:16.630 --> 38:17.360
I don't have time

38:17.360 --> 38:18.320
to listen to your nonsense.

38:19.190 --> 38:20.190
You're simply incorrigible.

38:27.230 --> 38:27.960
From now on,

38:28.390 --> 38:29.680
I'll make delicious food for you every day

38:29.710 --> 38:30.760
to help you recover.

38:31.320 --> 38:32.400
Now I'm the most powerful

38:32.430 --> 38:33.550
alchemical cultivator on the mountain.

38:33.920 --> 38:34.690
The food I make

38:34.800 --> 38:36.030
is not only delicious but also beneficial for your health.

38:36.590 --> 38:37.360
Master,

38:37.360 --> 38:38.000
you must eat it.

38:38.480 --> 38:39.400
Only when you're healed

38:39.590 --> 38:40.280
can you continue to bicker

38:40.300 --> 38:41.880
with your rebellious disciple for a long time, right?

38:52.720 --> 38:53.810
Look what your little disciple

38:53.840 --> 38:55.030
cooked for you.

38:56.190 --> 38:57.440
Red bean porridge.

38:58.440 --> 39:00.360
Red beans cure lovesickness.

39:01.760 --> 39:02.930
The response you've been waiting for for over a decade

39:02.960 --> 39:04.070
is right before your eyes.

39:04.230 --> 39:05.840
Can you bear to die?

39:07.070 --> 39:09.480
Are you really so cruel to yourself?

39:11.800 --> 39:12.440
Master,

39:13.800 --> 39:14.550
I don't believe

39:15.480 --> 39:16.800
that none of what you did for me

39:17.400 --> 39:18.480
was out of love.

39:19.320 --> 39:20.550
You have your own convictions,

39:20.760 --> 39:22.070
and I have mine.

39:22.590 --> 39:23.480
You're holding onto yours,

39:23.760 --> 39:24.550
and I'm holding onto mine.

39:25.320 --> 39:26.320
We have a long future ahead.

39:26.880 --> 39:28.030
I won't give up.

39:30.190 --> 39:31.520
Let me stay with you.

39:32.190 --> 39:33.670
This time, the outcome will surely be different.

39:33.700 --> 39:34.390
Trust me.

39:35.960 --> 39:37.150
I'll grant you power.

39:37.630 --> 39:38.800
You'll be able to control me.

39:39.510 --> 39:41.550
Dominating the universe with the beauty in your arms.

39:41.880 --> 39:43.480
No one will dare harm Xue Ranran again.

39:46.550 --> 39:47.590
If I keep you,

39:48.810 --> 39:50.370
it will only be me who hurts her in the future.

39:51.360 --> 39:52.760
I will never let the past repeat itself.

40:02.580 --> 40:06.060
[Wester Sect]

40:12.100 --> 40:13.840
[Su Yishui, I have urgent matters to discuss with you in person. It about Ranran. Su Yu.]

40:21.300 --> 40:22.250
Su Yu has already seen through

40:22.280 --> 40:23.400
Ranran's true identity.

40:25.280 --> 40:25.960
Guardian,

40:26.530 --> 40:27.450
then what does he mean

40:27.480 --> 40:28.480
by sending this letter?

40:29.510 --> 40:30.670
He didn't tell me in the letter.

40:31.330 --> 40:32.810
But actually, back in Puxin Village,

40:32.840 --> 40:33.760
Su Yu had already known

40:33.760 --> 40:35.000
the true identity of Mu Ranwu.

40:36.150 --> 40:37.190
Yet he kept quiet about it,

40:37.690 --> 40:39.130
and instead, he helped her enter the Marrow-Cleansing Pool.

40:39.960 --> 40:41.570
He must be plotting something.

40:42.360 --> 40:43.760
I guess what he's plotting

40:44.280 --> 40:45.110
is related to the Dragon Mother

40:45.110 --> 40:46.150
in Puxin Village.

40:47.470 --> 40:48.880
Guardian, are you saying...

40:49.810 --> 40:50.640
Could it be that Su Yu's target

40:50.670 --> 40:51.760
was Meng Zhang?

40:52.760 --> 40:53.280
Could it be

40:53.380 --> 40:55.000
that his appearance in Puxin Village at that time

40:55.070 --> 40:55.960
wasn't a coincidence?

40:56.670 --> 40:57.760
This cousin of mine

40:58.190 --> 40:59.800
is much more shrewd than I am.

41:00.710 --> 41:02.230
These past few days, my injuries have improved.

41:02.960 --> 41:04.000
I should indeed go to the palace

41:04.000 --> 41:05.360
to get the Xuantian Teachings.

41:07.060 --> 41:08.090
And to see what he's

41:08.120 --> 41:08.930
really up to.

41:09.920 --> 41:10.960
What about Ranran?

41:27.350 --> 41:29.250
[Two days later]

41:49.030 --> 41:50.590
She will have her own life,

41:51.920 --> 41:52.710
a brand new life

41:54.360 --> 41:55.440
without me.

42:25.280 --> 42:25.800
Ranran,

42:28.280 --> 42:29.840
I bear much responsibility for your reincarnation,

42:30.840 --> 42:32.230
which is why I brought you back to the Wester Sect.

42:35.700 --> 42:36.910
Now, all our past favors and grudges are dissolved.

42:37.990 --> 42:38.950
And I have more important things

42:38.970 --> 42:39.720
to attend to now.

42:42.630 --> 42:43.670
I won't come back again.

42:45.030 --> 42:46.190
You should leave on your own.

42:53.630 --> 42:55.070
If you still consider me your master,

42:56.480 --> 42:57.190
promise me

42:58.360 --> 42:59.960
you won't be held back by anything.

43:01.630 --> 43:02.960
Live as freely as the wind.
